  "Pooka_vo_disappear_01": "むむっ！　[RUBY:BASE ]今[RUBY:BEGIN ]いま[RUBY:END ]のは[RUBY:BASE ]偶然[RUBY:BEGIN ]ぐうぜん[RUBY:END ]！　[RUBY:BASE ]偶然[RUBY:BEGIN ]ぐうぜん[RUBY:END ]なり！\r\n[RUBY:BASE ]必然[RUBY:BEGIN ]ひつぜん[RUBY:END ]にあらず。[RUBY:BASE ]断[RUBY:BEGIN ]だん[RUBY:END ]じてそれに[RUBY:BASE ]相違[RUBY:BEGIN ]そうい[RUBY:END ]なし！",
