  "LV_004900_0000_CER": "[RUBY:BASE ]平気[RUBY:BEGIN ]へいき[RUBY:END ]、[RUBY:BASE ]平気[RUBY:BEGIN ]へいき[RUBY:END ]よ……。[RUBY:BASE ]丈夫[RUBY:BEGIN ]じょうぶ[RUBY:END ]な[RUBY:BASE ]葉[RUBY:BEGIN ]は[RUBY:END ]っぱだもの。\r\n[RUBY:BASE ]沈[RUBY:BEGIN ]しず[RUBY:END ]んだりしないわ、きっと……",
