  "SM_004020_0060_NAR": "[RUBY:BASE ]飛[RUBY:BEGIN ]と[RUBY:END ]び[RUBY:BASE ]出[RUBY:BEGIN ]だ[RUBY:END ]してきたウサギを[RUBY:BASE ]見[RUBY:BEGIN ]み[RUBY:END ]て、\r\nほっと[RUBY:BASE ]一安心[RUBY:BEGIN ]ひとあんしん[RUBY:END ]……。\r\n",
