  "BK_4090_0010_CER": "「[RUBY:BASE ]待[RUBY:BEGIN ]ま[RUBY:END ]って、マミー！\r\nもう[RUBY:BASE ]私[RUBY:BEGIN ]わたし[RUBY:END ]を[RUBY:BASE ]一人[RUBY:BEGIN ]ひとり[RUBY:END ]にしないで！」",
