  "LV_004085_0010_NAR": "『こんな[RUBY:BASE ]傷[RUBY:BEGIN ]きず[RUBY:END ]、オレは[RUBY:BASE ]平気[RUBY:BEGIN ]へいき[RUBY:END ]だ。\r\n……でも、このリボンは[RUBY:BASE ]嫌[RUBY:BEGIN ]きら[RUBY:END ]いじゃない』",
  "LV_004905_0000_CER": "チェシャ、あなた[RUBY:BASE ]泳[RUBY:BEGIN ]およ[RUBY:END ]げるの！？\r\n……わ、[RUBY:BASE ]私[RUBY:BEGIN ]わたし[RUBY:END ]は[RUBY:BASE ]服[RUBY:BEGIN ]ふく[RUBY:END ]を[RUBY:BASE ]濡[RUBY:BEGIN ]ぬ[RUBY:END ]らすのはイヤよ！",
