  "BK_4060_0010_POO": "「されど……。たとえこの[RUBY:BASE ]身燃[RUBY:BEGIN ]みも[RUBY:END ]え[RUBY:BASE ]尽[RUBY:BEGIN ]つ[RUBY:END ]きるとも！\r\n[RUBY:BASE ]悪[RUBY:BEGIN ]あ[RUBY:END ]しき[RUBY:BASE ]者[RUBY:BEGIN ]もの[RUBY:END ]ども、[RUBY:BASE ]許[RUBY:BEGIN ]ゆる[RUBY:END ]さでおくべきか！」\r\n",
