  "BK_4020_0010_POO": "「[RUBY:BASE ]聞[RUBY:BEGIN ]き[RUBY:END ]け！　わが[RUBY:BASE ]愛[RUBY:BEGIN ]いと[RUBY:END ]しき[RUBY:BASE ]王国[RUBY:BEGIN ]おうこく[RUBY:END ]に　\r\n[RUBY:BASE ]憂[RUBY:BEGIN ]うれ[RUBY:END ]いと[RUBY:BASE ]混沌[RUBY:BEGIN ]こんとん[RUBY:END ]をまきちらす、[RUBY:BASE ]小[RUBY:BEGIN ]こ[RUBY:END ]わらわよ！\r\n[RUBY:BASE ]禁忌[RUBY:BEGIN ]きんき[RUBY:END ]の[RUBY:BASE ]子[RUBY:BEGIN ]こ[RUBY:END ]を[RUBY:BASE ]目覚[RUBY:BEGIN ]めざ[RUBY:END ]めさせ、\r\nいかなる[RUBY:BASE ]悪戯[RUBY:BEGIN ]あくぎ[RUBY:END ]、たくらむか！」",
